# Test Execution Modes - Stage 2 Implementation
# Tests: strict, continue, and interactive modes with error handling

log === Testing Execution Modes ===

# Test 1: Continue mode (default)
log Test 1: Continue mode - errors logged, execution continues
mode continue

launch Calculator
wait 2

find 5
click
wait 0.5

# This will fail but continue mode will keep going
find NonExistentButton
click

# This should still execute despite previous error
find 3
click
wait 0.5

log Continue mode test complete - check error summary

# Test 2: Strict mode
log Test 2: Strict mode - stops on first error
mode strict

find 9
click
wait 0.5

# This will fail and stop execution in strict mode
find AnotherNonExistent
click

# This line should NOT execute in strict mode
log This should not print in strict mode

log === Execution Modes Test Complete ===
